   "subject": "bug in aaply? Why does aaply(data,2,class) returns “data.frame” for all columns?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Hi, I was playing around with the plyr function and discovered that aaply(data,2,class) returns a vector of length ncol(data) filled with “data.frame”. I would expect that it returns a vector with the class of the variables in the dataframe. As a consequence, testing which columns are numerical also fails. Below is some code to illustrate my point. <div><br></div><div>Thanks and best!</div><div><br></div><div>ps: I started the discussion here <a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/q/10673771/1318686\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/q/10673771/1318686&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792358517316000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2uEf2B9slDvl70F5cFhjK2\">http://stackoverflow.com/q/10673771/1318686</a> and someone pointed me to this list noting &quot;It [the help page] says that dataframe input should be accepted [for a*ply functions] and that an array should be the output. So you have discovered either an error in the documentation or a bug in the function&quot;</div><div><br><div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"margin-bottom:10px;padding:5px;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;line-height:18px;text-align:left\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">data</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">data</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">frame</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">str</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">rep</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;str&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">3</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">num</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">c</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">:</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">3</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">))</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\"><br><br></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#00008b\">class</font><font color=\"#000000\">(</font></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">data</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">[,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">])</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\"><br></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:gray\"># &quot;factor</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\"><br></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#00008b\">class</font></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">data</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">[,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">])</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\"><br></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:gray\"># &quot;integer&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\"><br><br>aaply</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">data</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,139)\">class</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\"><br></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:gray\"># &quot;data.frame&quot; &quot;data.frame&quot;</span></code></pre><pre style=\"margin-bottom:10px;padding:5px;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;line-height:18px;text-align:left\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"><pre style=\"margin-bottom:10px;padding:5px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">aaply</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">data</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">2</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,139)\">is</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">.</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">numeric</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span></pre><pre style=\"margin-bottom:10px;padding:5px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:gray\"># FALSE FALSE</span></pre></span></code></pre></div></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
